              "value": "**Alluring Spores**\nDC: 19\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\nMaximum Duration: 6 rounds\n- Stage 1: fascinated by the yaiafineti (1 round)\n- Stage 2: controlled by the yaiafineti (1 round)"
